1171+ 7871 C5               push bc
1172+ 7872 78               ld   a, b
1173+ 7873 C6 0F            add  a, 15
1174+ 7875 47               ld   b, a
1175+ 7876 CD 30 78         call CheckWallCell
1176+ 7879 38 03            jr   c, .collision
1177+ 787B
1178+ 787B C1               pop  bc
1179+ 787C B7               or   a                 ; Reset carry (nessuna collisione)
1180+ 787D C9               ret
