 660+ 82A8              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 661+ 82A8              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 662+ 82A8              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 663+ 82A8              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 664+ 82A8                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 665+ 82A8                  ; Byte 2:
 666+ 82A8 3A 13 A0         ld   a, (player_score + 2)
